@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title FC-06  Personal roadmap lifecycle
' Requirements: ROAD-01 ROAD-02 ROAD-03 ROAD-04 ROAD-05 ROAD-06 ROAD-07 ROAD-08 ROAD-09 PROGRESS-03 PROFILE-01 AI-05 AI-06 P-04 P-05
start
if (Request new or replacement roadmap?) then (yes)
  :Resolve request under FC-07 shared saved-outcome rules;
  note right
Apply shared saved-outcome rules (diagram index / FC-07).
Resolve accessible success before new-generation checks:
no generation or extra usage, even at 20 used or during outage.
Permissions, privacy, deletion/expiry and current catalog apply.
end note
  if (Accessible saved proposal or successful new generation?) then (yes)
    :Use saved or new proposal; no automatic activation;
    if (Suitable complete plan available?) then (yes)
      :Preview ordered courses and reasons for explicit acceptance;
      if (Student explicitly accepts?) then (yes)
        :Make this the one active roadmap;
        :Preserve course records and badges;
      else (no)
        :Keep current active plan, if any;
        stop
      endif
    else (no)
      :Explain catalog gap; keep current plan;
      stop
    endif
  else (no)
    :Explain unmet condition; preserve current plan;
    stop
  endif
else (view existing)
  if (An accepted active roadmap exists?) then (yes)
    :Open accepted active roadmap;
  else (no)
    :Show no active roadmap and offer a new request;
    stop
  endif
endif
:Show completed included courses / total courses;
if (All included courses complete?) then (yes)
  :Show Completed; no separate roadmap badge;
else (no)
  if (Any archived course not yet started?) then (yes)
    :Show course unavailable without marking it complete;
    :Offer a replacement request; never replace silently;
  else (no)
    :Continue learning; courses already started\nkeep their original revision;
  endif
  if (Weekly hours and all unfinished-course estimates supplied?) then (yes)
    :Show approximate duration using full estimates\nfor unfinished courses;
  else (no)
    :Show course order without duration;
  endif
endif
note right
Roadmap progress displays 100% only when every
included course is complete.
Rounding keeps unfinished progress below 100%.
No deadlines or penalties.
External AI roadmaps remain deferred.
end note
stop
footer CS-GAMUERS | FC-06 | Product behavior
@enduml
